WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.550
With Ingrid’s back near the left wall, Ryu blocks the opening heavy kick.

2
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.100
The back throw moves Ryu toward the corner beneath the held light-Level-2 rain.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:07.600
Light Sun Flare stores one Crest before the OD pickup.

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.100
OD Sun Flare spends the stored Crest and relaunches Ryu.

5
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:09.650
The two performed heavy Sun Shots extend the corner juggle.

6
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.000
Light Sun Rise ends the recorded rain conversion.
